    <briefdescription>
<para>Material that draws candles from (x, open, high, low, close) data points in a data texture. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Each candle takes <computeroutput>kVerticesPerCandle</computeroutput> vertices: two triangles each for three parts, the wick above and below the body and the body of a candlestick, or the line and two ticks of an OHLC bar. The shader derives the candle, part, and corner from the vertex index. The inherited <computeroutput>color</computeroutput> is the up candle color. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
